            "       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.",
            "       01 I PIC 9.",
            "       PROCEDURE DIVISION.",
            "           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 3",
            "               DISPLAY I.",
            "           END-PERFORM.",
            "           STOP RUN."
          ],
          "answer": 7,
          "explanation": "The period after DISPLAY I ends the sentence, so END-PERFORM stands alone. Remove it."
        },
        {
          "id": "cb11-l2-e6",
          "type": "multiple_choice",
          "prompt": "When is a paragraph better than an inline PERFORM?",
          "options": [
